# {{PROJECT}} validation

How to run and check the code of each repo of {{PROJECT}}. Agents read a repo's section before they
build or review a change, with `second-brain validation "{{PROJECT}}" <repo>`. Each repo has one
`## <repo>` section; `second-brain validation new "{{PROJECT}}" <repo>` adds a missing one.
